<title>NORWAY: Nera Q1 pre-tax profits edge down.</title>
<headline>Nera Q1 pre-tax profits edge down.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenues		 540.9	vs    628.5</p>
<p> Operating results		   29.8	vs     35.3</p>
<p> Pre-tax result			26.4	vs     26.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian telecommunications company is Nera ASA.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
